Dimwit's Room
You stare around in awe as you realize that you are within the private bedroom 
of Lord Dimwit Flathead. The canopied bed alone is larger than most of the 
farms in your home province. Light seeps in through slitted windows, and 
doorways lead east and south.

Magic Clothes Closet
This is a small closet. Well, it's small by the standards of this castle; in a 
pinch, it could probably sleep a few regiments. The only exit is north.
