This was just the vault where Dimwit stored his 
trifles; his valuables were stored in a hidden 
vault buried seven miles under the Flathead 
Mountains, accessible only by a chain of 
sixty-three secret teleportation spells. The only
exit is north.
   You can see a stock certificate here.

