led to the gallows and hung from the neck until dead.

     531
>read sign
"Sinners, take note!
1. We cannot execute everyone at once! Please take a number!
2. Everyone is permitted a final request.
3. Tell the executioner your request when your number is called.
4. If we cannot grant your final wish, we shall be quick and merciful. We will 
behead you.
5. If we CAN grant your final wish, we will hang you. Please note that this is 
slow and excruciatingly painful."
   A trollish guard drags someone in, who obediently takes a number from the 
number dispenser.
   The executioner calls out, "Number 41!" and a bedraggled man steps forward. 
"Executioner, sing a song," he croaks. The executioner says, "Done!" and the 
man is led to the gallows and hung from the neck until dead.

     532
>wait
Time passes...
   The executioner calls out, "Number 42!" and looks at you with an ugly grin.

     533
>executioner, behead me
The executioner says, "Hey, sure! Easy request! I can behead ya!" Then a 
confused look creeps over his face. "But if I behead ya, then I done granted 
yer last wish, and I gotta hang ya! But if I hang ya, I ain't granted yer wish,
and I gotta behead ya! But..." He trails off. "Guards, throw this wise guy 
outta here!" Guards surround you and escort you out.
